        "body_1": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>We started Healistix because the sea moss we kept seeing on the market didn't taste like the sea moss in our house. Most of what's sold as \"wildcrafted\" is pool-grown, dried twice, and rehydrated on a warehouse floor somewhere. It's not bad for you. It's just not what we'd hand our kids.</p>"
          }
        },
        "body_2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>So we built Healistix to do one thing: make the jar we'd actually give our family, and sell it at a price our neighbors could afford. Every batch is blended in small 80-jar runs. Every jar has a lab report you can download. Every bottle of batana comes directly from a Miskito cooperative in Honduras. And every order ships with the same rule we’ve had on the wall from day one.</p>"
          }
        }
